    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\n N_0(0)=1,\\quad\n N_j(A)=\\sum_{B<A}N_{j-1}(B),\\quad\n j\\le A\\le\\lfloor\\log_2(3^j)\\rfloor.                   \\tag{23}\n"
  },
